# Normalize to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Everything here is text, and two things break on CRLF regardless of the
# platform you edit on: the git pre-commit hook (a /bin/sh script, which
# will not run with CRLF line endings under Git Bash or WSL), and diffs
# between a Windows author and everyone else. Settling this in the first
# commit avoids a whole-file line-ending diff later.
* text=auto eol=lf
